<title>USA: Texas Utilities unit to redeem 2022 bonds.</title>
<headline>Texas Utilities unit to redeem 2022 bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Utilities Electric Co, a unit of Texas Utilities Co, on Friday said it plans to redeem all the outstanding $100 million principal amount of its nine percent first mortgage and collateral trust bonds due 2022.</p>
<p>TU Electric said bonds will be redeemed on April 1, 1997, at a redemption price of 106.62 percent of principal amount.</p>
<p>The regular semi-annual interest payment due on April 1 will be made, the company said.</p>
<p>((--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
